## TIẾNG ANH · 16:30–17:00

> *"The model key never ships in the binary. The phone calls my API; my API calls Gemini under a tight rate limit; the response is Zod-parsed before it touches the UI. If the model returns garbage I fail closed, not with a half-parsed meal."*

**5 từ:** `fail closed` · `binary` · `rate limit` · `garbage` · `Zod-parsed`

